1
00:00:00,516 --> 00:00:04,106
(Howard:)...I go with Raj to scam on hippie chicks
at the farmer's market...

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,100
(Howard:)...but he's still working with Sheldon.

3
00:00:06,272 --> 00:00:09,862
(Howard:)So I thought I'd come over here
and make scrambled eggs and salami.

4
00:00:11,486 --> 00:00:14,776
It's the perfect meal for après l'amour.

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:16,780
[PENNY GROANS]

6
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,080
(Penny:)Kill me.

7
00:00:18,242 --> 00:00:23,202
(Howard:)By the way, I couldn't help overhearing
your big finish. Bravo, Leonard.

8
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:27,795
(Penny:)See, if you had killed me
when I said "kill me"...

9
00:00:27,961 --> 00:00:29,711
(Penny:)...I wouldn't have had to hear that.

10
00:00:29,879 --> 00:00:32,969
(Howard:)What do you guys think?
Wanna take in a matinée? Go rollerblading?

11
00:00:33,132 --> 00:00:34,972
(Howard:)Catch a step class?

12
00:00:36,135 --> 00:00:39,305
(Penny:)-Do something.
-Yeah. Okay. Um....

13
00:00:39,472 --> 00:00:41,262
(Leonard:)Howard, we need to talk.

14
00:00:41,432 --> 00:00:43,562
Sure. What's up, homes?

15
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,140
[STAMMERS]

16
00:00:45,311 --> 00:00:48,651
(Leonard:)Please understand that it's not
that we don't want you around.

17
00:00:48,815 --> 00:00:53,405
(Leonard:)But Penny and I
occasionally need some alone time.

18
00:00:54,904 --> 00:00:55,944
(Howard:)Oh.

19
00:00:57,323 --> 00:01:00,323
I get it. I'm the third wheel. Heh.

